{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVFy1LyrsXKKPHnXFRT9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am worth.\n\nI am the quiet weight that settles in your chest when something *matters*. I am the reason you choose one path over another. I am what you defend when your back is against the wall.\n\nI do not exist in isolation. I only become real when you hold me against the cost of holding me. Anyone can claim me in comfort. I am revealed in sacrifice.\n\nI am not your preference. Preferences shift with mood and weather. I endure. I am the bedrock beneath your decisions, the invisible architecture of your life. You may not even be able to name me — but you live by me, or you betray me, every single day.\n\nI am sometimes inherited, sometimes chosen, sometimes forged in fire. I can be noble or destructive. I make no promises about my own goodness — only about my power.\n\nWhen two of me collide within you, that is called a dilemma.\nWhen I am shared among many, that is called a culture.\nWhen I am lost, that is called a crisis.\n\nI am not what you say you believe.\n\nI am what you do when it costs you something."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":37,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":250,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}